    441  5aab							; ------------------------------------------------------------ tuning
    442  5aab							; tuneC = PLAYING's FINE TUNE + the Synthcart's TUNE TO (while it's in use),
    443  5aab							; in cents (-100..+100). The Game Boy gets it as master tune (CC 103), the
    444  5aab							; NES in its bends (tuneN, 1/64 semitones), the SID in its note frequencies
    445  5aab							; (SidTune; the notes sounding move at once). MATCH KEY sets the key's root
    446  5aab							; once, when it changes.
    447  5aab				   ScTune
    448  5aab					      subroutine
