    234  5d69							; ------------------------------------------------------------ One Key Play
    235  5d69							; CRSR DOWN or CRSR RIGHT (A = 1 / 2: which) pressed, ONE KEY PLAY on: the
    236  5d69							; phrase's next step sounds. PENTATONIC PAIRS: two notes of the key's
    237  5d69							; pentatonic scale, one apart (a third or a fourth), across the overlay's two
    238  5d69							; octaves. CHORD NOTES: one note of the chord (the keys held or latched),
    239  5d69							; over two octaves. EACH PRESS CUTS the last step or lets it RING ON (until
    240  5d69							; the next). The notes sound while either key is down (latch: until the next
